<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Distilled from End Bent 2 Cap Design 10-17.html (generated 2026-10-17T18:17:21+00:00); same case (canonical SHA-256 def91929e977) and C005 formula set (327838126d06) as the report; FBMP End Bent 2_Fixed.XML (56f78267b769); cap notebook package cfb3565da8c3.</p></text>
